    { "type": "richtext", "id": "info_body", "label": "Body", "default": "<p><strong>Getting around</strong></p><p>Tap any glowing marker on your map to open it. Finish a course and the trail lights up to the next step. The wooden signs (RAFT, GROWS, ROOTED) explain the frameworks; the glowing checkpoints (Mindset, Purpose, Heart) keep you steady between courses.</p><p><strong>Access and your account</strong></p><p>Your progress saves to your account. If you ever lose access to a course, it's almost always a billing hiccup — update your payment info and you're back in. Have an access code? Enter it on the journey page to unlock.</p><p><strong>Account housekeeping</strong></p><p>Sign in to your account to update your details. If you use a password and forgot it, choose “Forgot password?” on the sign-in page for a reset link. Need to change the email on file, or can't get in? Email support and we'll take care of it.</p><p><strong>Need help?</strong></p><p>Email support@blacksheepcreations.com with your account email and what you were doing when it happened — we'll get you sorted.</p><p><strong>An honest note</strong></p><p>This is education and tools, not a promise of income. We hand you the map and the raft; the crossing is yours to make.</p>" },
